THE RAPIDITY ALGEBRA: WHEN MUSICAL INTERVALS CLOSE
============================================================

  Condition: c = ab/(a+b+1) is a positive integer.
  Equivalently: (a+b+1) | ab.

STRUCTURE THEOREM
----------------------------------------

  Let d = gcd(a, a+b+1). Then d | a and d | (a+b+1).
  Since d | a, d | (a+b+1-a) = b+1. So d | gcd(a, b+1).
  Similarly let e = gcd(b, a+b+1). Then e | gcd(b, a+1).

  (a+b+1) | ab iff (a+b+1)/gcd(a,a+b+1) | b
  iff (a+b+1)/gcd(a,b+1) | b

  So the condition depends on gcd(a, b+1) and gcd(b, a+1).

  Found 160 solutions with a <= 50, b <= 200:

